# Not written:
#   Rule @900.0: '$$ Management Servers' holds members whose addresses are not known
#   updates by name: host names as the destination: Cato takes them as destinations on the internet only
#   ping out: its services cannot be written: an ICMP type, ICMPv6, SCTP or another IP protocol: a custom service of Cato is TCP, UDP or ICMP
#   no social: its services cannot be written: no port mapping for application(s) Facebook; supply one with --app-map
#   gre to isp: its services cannot be written: an ICMP type, ICMPv6, SCTP or another IP protocol: a custom service of Cato is TCP, UDP or ICMP
#   lan but admins: its services cannot be written: source ports: a service of Cato has destination ports only
#   v6 web: no IPv4 address as the source
#   v6 ping: its services cannot be written: an ICMP type, ICMPv6, SCTP or another IP protocol: a custom service of Cato is TCP, UDP or ICMP
#   v6 mail: no IPv4 address as the source
#   v6 guests: no IPv4 address as the destination
#   Rule @952.0: no IPv4 address as the source
#   Rule @953.0: no IPv4 address as the source
